(text "BENCH ONLY: regulated 5.0 V + shared ESP 3.3 V; keep disconnected from vehicle." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "7cf22a6e-ca02-5c07-88b1-fc7cc4422293"))
(text "Hardware: window watchdog + both rail supervisors + physical held enable + READY -> asynchronous latch clear." (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "838784e2-6d4a-576c-9b3d-867a21135f44"))
(text "Two post-READY WDI falling edges -> HB_GOOD; fresh physical ARM rising edge with requests all LOW -> ARMED." (at 20 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "fa35e3b4-7da5-5d9c-8f81-1c37570d6672"))
(text "3.3 V COIL_PERMIT is only for relay gate input. External enable pole J3(1-2) physically interrupts coil power." (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "bcfc7f4c-6749-5536-9b95-29e496fbbb3e"))
(text "J5 pin 7 returns carrier post-enable/pre-cutoff 5 V: R22 monitors actual feed; never connect this 5 V wire to ESP." (at 20 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "8e0bd790-3762-5b9f-8b9d-e68882cfae81"))
(text "A. POWER AND WATCHDOG: rail monitors remain independent of the ESP application." (at 20 95 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f1b8ce49-6a8e-5fe9-8e81-dcf80323f164"))
(text "B. QUALIFICATION AND ARM: asynchronous fault clear; two heartbeat stages; fresh physical ARM edge." (at 20 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "9b78587a-ce49-5840-8f6b-317385974b99"))
(text "J3: external held DPST-NO enable, no jumper in deployed setup. J4: separate normally-open ARM button." (at 20 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "a0334302-952a-55fc-9a8d-e4ffd9c98f83"))
(text "Output is not a semantic command/plausibility monitor. Driver/relay/ECU timing requires measured bench validation." (at 20 285 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2539e04d-1542-53d4-83c3-3096944aae42"))
(text "C. OUTPUT AND INTERFACES: 3.3 V permission is for the carrier MOSFET gate only; carrier feedback is 5 V." (at 20 290 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "eea8c47f-193b-595d-bbda-e2ada1df10f7"))
(text "D. PASSIVES: connected by named nets; place each U's 100 nF physically at its supply pins." (at 20 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "8eb7b0d9-c9a0-5812-a854-472a3759692b"))
(text "E. SUPPLY FLAGS: rails are externally driven or passively fed; flags are not physical components." (at 20 535 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "f4e25626-86ad-58c5-9030-c9f6862d7103"))
